{"title":"Mississauga: Outdoor Friendly Soccer","startsAt":"2026-10-11T08:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-11T10:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Welcome everyone! Friendly Pick up game of soccer! All levels and genders are welcome. Please bring a white and colored shirt. Free parking available as well.\n\nThis event is free to attend. Arguments or fighting will not be tolerated and you will be asked to leave if you initiate any. Please RSVP and make sure you are on the \"going\" list in order to attend.","venue":{"name":"Hawthorne Valley Park","address":"159 Ceremonial Dr, Mississauga","lat":43.605415,"lng":-79.663918,"city":"Mississauga"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Soccer Meetup","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/a/e/9/highres_465836041.jpeg"}